        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "8ed4bddbf837cf6115274880eeb2efeba26de01086d7bac9ca7a54149cd320b1",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "凱旋門賞の夢",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0116eb1c201c337d14720cd0f9f9f46a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "fe4c518f4ad091186537814d77fd0489fa2e5b7f9b10aabdbf2a7d96c53b451b",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "今週末、%CHARA% が %YOU% を外出に誘った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7a17200b53c2e541d21103fd893c91cd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "233e3f85f81ec7f55d3908b67dca3ae111485a5e3e6a8c0a1f0fb6e601041252",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "名目は次の海外遠征の打ち合わせだ。だがレストランの個室で、%SEX%と %YOU% は向かい合ったまま、しばし言葉がない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d5006724ac97314dd0e5b48e78e432fc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "1d8f6dbe5a31cbbc474350d5e862dd316f4d57c0c6582bf72733dd6e895e1326",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "しばらくして、%SEX%は口を開いた。「……お前のおかげだよ。海外遠征、ここまで来れたのはな」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f3905f132e4cc313ae13fa5fc0f314d5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        3,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "7e269664cde59b75f98c80d085c62e325e6719a0e1bf716c37dc9e368b720525",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "「凱旋門賞の栄冠は、もう手にしてる。でもな——まだ、お前と叶える夢は残ってるんだ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3ce9ea36ccae78937d52d0d0f13be695",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "51ad362ee599f43a5c0b70dd37152854e083cfc6bd3937048732dc965b481938",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "「まだ凱旋門賞は取れてねえ。でもお前が押してくれるなら、この夢は絶対に本物になる」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ac6f85c7430439fe141c58f144b5fdce",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        5
      ],
      "originalHash": "6d00675b7bec694dcce180d56b6d125ba4cbfb2eb94ad4a35c891ffa5c3983fe",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "どちらにせよ、%YOU% は%SEX%にとって、夢を追ういちばん大切な相棒だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ebacf9f02eb37c95d3054b411ae30852",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "8255bcae34a05d540b0d07bc8bd0c0b8b0502d635000787c2d99aa81187d5106",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "深く息を吸い、%SEX%は何かを決めたように、ゆっくりと頭の帽子を外した。下から、一対のウマ耳が現れる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2bb487865eac5996c6d53684c83a99ec",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a7ee11ec454ad43775e0a2c9042f87f8df6653027b6db1470250f33a4319799a",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "「……本当の名前は、%CHARA_ACTUAL%だ。今まで身分を隠してて、悪かった。これから先は、もっと正直にやろうぜ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7b175e2f9eac50f658861e620580ad74",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "ce56a564aa667a4302fcbfe3e9c102291fdd19bf9c6a7cdc07738bbc67db82c4",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "最後に、%SEX%は %YOU% へ杯を掲げる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d2da5509119255868f35805d7030c034",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904300-Satake-Mei/love-343.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "850d2ef437e5fb17cb14f2033b880a180548009411c3683bc702158b87644666",
      "sourceFileHash": "c69451d1c25940f39b1a7927584b8d03f698cb60fce3766b930966ba70a0e6b4",
      "originalText": "コーヒーの湯気に隠れた双眸の奥で、情が、そっと光った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    }
  ]
}
